       This program is part of NNeettppbbmm(1).

       ppbbmmttoommrrff converts a PBM image to MRF format.

       For more information about mrf, see tthhee MMRRFF specification" (1).

       ppbbmmttoommrrff takes the PBM image from the file named by the _i_n_p_u_t_._p_b_m argu‐
       ment, or Standard Input if you don't  specify  _i_n_p_u_t_._p_b_m.   The  output
       goes to Standard Output.

       The  compression  of the edges of pictures with width and/or height not
       an exact multiple of 64 is not optimal in all cases.


